      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this way, and I hear how much pain you are in right now. Please know that you are not going to disappear, and you do not have to wait for that \"hollow shell\" to happen. You are still here, and your thoughts and feelings are real, even when they feel like they are fading. It is very hard to hold on when everything feels like it is slipping away, but you are not alone in this.",
