      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way, and your desire to avoid becoming a burden is a very human reaction to feeling like you are losing yourself. Please know that you are not a burden, and your existence is valuable even if you cannot always articulate who you are. You do not have to \"hold on\" to something that feels like it is slipping away, but you also do not have to stop before you are gone. There is a middle ground where you can be present without forcing yourself to remember things you cannot.",
